  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_01",
      "hash64": "5D19715F176D5587",
      "text": "Laut meinem Terminkalender steht jetzt das\\nMeeting mit dem Top-Champ an.\\r\\nStattdessen habe ich unangemeldeten Besuch.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_02",
      "hash64": "5D19725F176D573A",
      "text": "Das sieht ihr ähnlich. Ja, ich kann mir schon\\ndenken, weshalb du hier bist.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "D91C9440602F3F4A",
      "text": "Danke, dass Sie sich die Zeit nehmen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "D91C9340602F3D97",
      "text": "Vielen Dank für Ihre Kooperation.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_03",
      "hash64": "5D19735F176D58ED",
      "text": "Nicht der Rede wert.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_04",
      "hash64": "5D196C5F176D4D08",
      "text": "Der Top-Champ ist meine Vorgesetzte, daher\\nsteht es mir nicht zu, ihre Entscheidungen\\r\\nanzuzweifeln.\\c\\nAber es überrascht mich schon, dass sie jetzt\\nauch Schüler beschäftigt...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_05",
      "hash64": "5D196D5F176D4EBB",
      "text": "Soso. Du hilfst ihr aus, damit sie im Gegenzug an\\neinem Turnier eurer Akademie teilnehmen kann.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_06",
      "hash64": "5D196E5F176D506E",
      "text": "Na ja, das muss jeder selbst wissen. Ich hätte\\nmich nicht auf die zusätzliche Arbeit eingelassen.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_07",
      "hash64": "5D196F5F176D5221",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_08",
      "hash64": "5D19685F176D463C",
      "text": "Wie sieht’s aus? Wollen wir diese Aufgabe\\ndann auch mal erledigen?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_retry",
      "hash64": "3F87283E5A69AFBE",
      "text": "Unliebsame Arbeit bringt man am besten sofort\\nhinter sich. Wollen wir anfangen?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_09",
      "hash64": "5D19695F176D47EF",
      "text": "Dann lass uns mal zur Schatzstube schlappen.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_10",
      "hash64": "5D1CF65F17706D5D",
      "text": "Ich habe heute leider auch noch andere Termine,\\nwenn du also irgendwann so nett wärst...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
